    "text": "Driving to the dentist today with Rumba riding along w/us, he saw a boxer being walked & started doing his little whiny \"I want that\" grunts while staring out the window at the Big Dog Rumba Wants To Be Friends With. 😂\n\nHe Ignored Us for like 10 minutes.\n\nHow DARE we not let him meet a new friend‽",
