    "text": "She ended the call without saying goodbye. She figured it would be more dramatic for him that way. With luck he'd #start out for Ajax immediately and leave Sara alone.\n\nShe glanced back at the man. He was still staring out the window. His dog was looking at her, smiling. #vss365 #writing",
